      "actions": 3,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Noolik can cause a complex mechanical trap to continue longer than its normal duration. She moves up to her speed and Interacts with a trap. The trap can use its reaction during its next round as well as its routine, although its initiative doesn't change."
